title: Credits

Many works were referenced in the making of this game.

Thank you to these people who watched the development in the Discord but these guys are top tier: Con-all, therosewithmanythorns, cityslickerman

Thank you for Autumn for actually creating the OG game. Your a real one for that.

Thank you to Originn0 for making Dynamic for letting me 𝗌̶𝗍̶𝖾̶𝖺̶𝗅̶ borrow some feature/ideas (did you really need to raise the bar for modders)

Gotta thank Wikipedia and there legions of contributors for lots of information about the topics and pictures.


